        "@value": "Roddy Ellias & Lucas Haneman | lagrangedelagatineau"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\"Reviews have described Ellias as \"genius\", \"positively brilliant\" and \"exquisite …the kind of subtlety you don't often hear anywhere.\"\n\nHaneman has been described as “the greatest guitarist I have heard. Think Eric Clapton at his best in his youth and you will understand.\""
      }
