  {
    "@id": "https://www.grange.ca/fr/event-details-registration/songs-from-a-drunken-piano-1",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Songs From a Drunken Piano | lagrangedelagatineau"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "<p>English below*</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Cette revue unique de la musique de Tom Waits, poète, chanteur, compositeur, américain, présente Christine Fagan, Alise Marlane, Steve Berndt, Ken Kanwisher, Chris Breitner, et Matt Aston. Les harmonies vocales serrées sont accompagnées de guitare, banjo, harmonica, trombone, accordéon, cithare, égoïne, mandoline, violoncelle et plusieurs sons provenant de claviers synthétiseurs et d’instruments de percussion, dont un évier de cuisine.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v&#61;zltALrwDXWI\">Vidéo</a></p>\n<p>Site web: www.steveberndt.com/project/songs-from-a-drunken-piano-tom-waits-revue-2/</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>****************************</p>\n<p>This eclectic unique revue of the music of Tom Waits, the American poet/singer/songwriter features unique arrangements by Christine Fagan, Alise Marlane, Steve Berndt, Ken Kanwisher, Chris Breitner, and Matt Aston. Tight vocal harmonies are backed by guitar, banjo, blues harp, trombone, accordion, zither, bowed saw, mandolin, cello and many other synthesized keyboard sounds and percussion instruments including a kitchen sink.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v&#61;62f9kXsOrkc\">Video</a></p>\n<p>Website: www.steveberndt.com/project/songs-from-a-drunken-piano-tom-waits-revue-2/</p>\n<p></p>"
      }
    ],
